TITLE_ABOUT=About URTC Tester
ABOUT_TAGLINE=Desktop live CAN-bus diagnostic tool for URTC boards.
ABOUT_DESCRIPTION=Connects over the same USB-CAN adapter the flasher uses, detects which of the 25 tool profiles a board is jumpered for, and shows only that tool's own live controls and telemetry.
ABOUT_VERSION=Version
ABOUT_AUTHOR=Author
ABOUT_EMAIL=Email
ABOUT_LICENSE=License
BTN_CLOSE=Close

