LBL_BUS_STATS=Frames/s: {frames} | Bus load: {load}% (approx, {bitrate})
LOG_SELFTEST_TESTING=Testing: {tool}
LOG_SELFTEST_ACTIVE_TOOL=Active-tool query (0x110) confirms detected tool
LOG_SELFTEST_VERSION=Version query (0x7F8) gets a response
LOG_HW_NOTE_DIFFERENT=(expected 0x{expected} - different board/rig?)
MSG_NO_TOOL_FOR_JUMPERS=No tool is assigned to this jumper setting (raw ID {tool_id}). Nothing to test here - set the board's ID jumpers to a real tool profile.
