TITLE_REPLAY=Replay a Recorded Trace
HELP_REPLAY=Plays the received frames of a .trc or .asc trace into its own list, marked REPLAY, with no board. Nothing is transmitted, a recording never answers a request, and these frames are not exported as if the board had said them.
